{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04289","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 武三思","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此地岩壑数千重，吾君驾鹤□乘龙。\n掩暎叶光含翡翠，参差石影带芙蓉。\n白日将移冲叠巘，玄云欲度碍高峰。\n对酒鸣琴追野趣，时闻清吹入长松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武三思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}